<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Digital Signature Certificate (DSC) in Mumbai - Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - DSC in Mumbai Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>DSC services cover <strong>Class 3 DSC issuance</strong> (same-day for Indian nationals), <strong>renewal</strong> (30-day advance tracking), <strong>portal registration</strong> (MCA, GST, Income Tax, EPFO, GeM), <strong>emSigner setup</strong> and troubleshooting, <strong>foreign director/NRI DSC</strong> (attestation coordination), <strong>cloud DSC</strong> (remote signing), and <strong>bulk DSC</strong> for multiple directors.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper" style="margin-top:16px;"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Governing Law</td><td>IT Act 2000; CCA Regulations; Companies Act 2013; CGST Act 2017; Income Tax Act 1961</td></tr><tr><td>Applicable To</td><td>Company directors, LLP partners, CAs/CSs, GST signatories, e-tender bidders, EPFO employers</td></tr><tr><td>Timeline</td><td>Same-day (Indian with Aadhaar); 3-5 days (NRI/foreign); portal registration 30-60 min/portal</td></tr><tr><td>Cost From</td><td>Rs 1,500 (Class 3 Sign Only, 1 year, incl. token)</td></tr><tr><td>Key Challenge</td><td>PAN name mismatch; emSigner failures; expired DSC; foreign director delays; multi-portal association</td></tr><tr><td>Authority</td><td>CCA (MeitY); Licensed CAs (eMudhra, Sify, nCode, NSDL, Capricorn); RoC Mumbai</td></tr></tbody></table></div></p>
                </div>
                <p>Mumbai has <strong>500,000+ registered companies</strong> with RoC Mumbai - every director needs DSC for MCA filings. GST, Income Tax, e-tender, EPFO all require DSC. Same-day issuance at Marine Lines office. Learn more about <a href="#">DSC Services across India</a>.</p>
