<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS GSTAT APPEAL FILING -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">What Is a Digital Signature Certificate</h2>
                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p>A Digital Signature Certificate (DSC) is the <strong>electronic equivalent of a handwritten signature</strong>, legally valid under the Information Technology Act 2000. Issued by licensed Certifying Authorities under CCA (MeitY). <strong>Only Class 3 DSC</strong> is available since January 2021 (Class 1/2 phased out). Stored on <strong>USB crypto token</strong>.</p><p>Two types: <strong>Sign</strong> (for document/filing signing) and <strong>Sign &amp; Encrypt</strong> (signing + encrypted data exchange). Validity: 1/2/3 years. <strong>Aadhaar eKYC + video verification</strong> required. PAN name must exactly match. DSC needed for: <strong>MCA21</strong> (RoC filings), <strong>GST</strong> (company/LLP returns), <strong>Income Tax</strong> (audit-liable ITR), <strong>GeM/CPPP</strong> (e-tendering), <strong>EPFO/ICEGATE/DGFT</strong>. <strong>Cloud DSC</strong> now available for remote signing without USB token.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for DSC in Mumbai:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>Class 3 DSC:</strong> Only class available since Jan 2021. Highest identity assurance. Video verification. USB token. Sign or Sign &amp; Encrypt.</p><p><strong>emSigner:</strong> Utility for DSC signing on govt portals (IT, MCA, GST). Common failures: token detection, browser, Java, PAN mismatch.</p><p><strong>Portal Association:</strong> DSC registered separately on each portal: MCA (DIN/DPIN), GST (signatory), IT (emSigner), EPFO, GeM, ICEGATE.</p><p><strong>Cloud DSC:</strong> CCA-approved remote signing without USB token. OTP-based. Accepted on MCA, GST, DGFT. Sign from any device.</p><p><strong>PAN Name Match:</strong> DSC name must exactly match PAN - including middle name, initials, spelling. Most common rejection cause.</p>

                </div>
            </div>
