                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td>PAN Name Mismatch</td><td>DSC name must exactly match PAN - including middle name, initials, spelling. 'RAJESH KUMAR SHARMA' vs 'RAJESH K SHARMA' = MCA rejection. MCA V3 portal particularly strict.</td><td>Patron verifies PAN name against Income Tax database before DSC application. Zero mismatch rejections.</td></tr><tr><td>emSigner Utility Failures</td><td>emSigner not starting (Java version), token not detected (USB driver), browser blocking (security settings), certificate chain error, signing failed (PIN locked). Occurs at filing deadlines (31 Oct ITR, 31 Dec DIR-3 KYC).</td><td>Patron provides remote desktop troubleshooting within 30 minutes. emSigner configured correctly during initial setup. Critical for deadline filings.</td></tr><tr><td>Expired DSC Blocking Filings</td><td>Companies with multiple directors lose track of expiry. Expired DSC = locked out of MCA (MGT-7, AOC-4), GST returns, ITR. If ALL directors' DSCs expire, company cannot file anything.</td><td>Patron maintains expiry tracker for all client DSCs. Renewal initiated 30 days before expiry. Zero filing disruptions due to expired DSC.</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign Director DSC Delays</td><td>Non-resident directors (GCCs, foreign subsidiaries, JVs): no Aadhaar, passport attestation 5-15 working days, video verification across time zones.</td><td>Patron pre-plans foreign director DSC before filing deadlines. Attestation coordinated in advance. Video verification scheduled across time zones.</td></tr><tr><td>Multiple Portal Association</td><td>Director needs DSC on MCA21 + GST + Income Tax + potentially GeM/DGFT/EPFO. Each has different registration process. Users register on MCA but forget GST or IT = filing failure.</td><td>Patron registers DSC on ALL required portals in one session. Test signing on each portal. No missed registrations.</td></tr>

